    "selection_rationale": "Figure 12 identifies the peer companies that the HR and Compensation Committee approved in May 2023 for consideration in determining our executive officers\u2019 target compensation levels for fiscal 2024. The peer companies and Qualcomm are ranked, high-to-low, based on then-current market capitalization and revenues. There were no changes to the peer group from the prior year. Subsequently, in May 2024, the HR and Compensation Committee approved one peer addition (IBM Corporation) and two peer removals (VMware, Inc. and Charter Communications, Inc.) for purposes of fiscal 2025 compensation determ",
    "source_excerpt": "Figure 12 identifies the peer companies that the HR and Compensation Committee approved in May 2023 for consideration in determining our executive officers\u2019 target compensation levels for fiscal 2024. The peer companies and Qualcomm are ranked, high-to-low, based on then-current market capitalization and revenues. There were no changes to the peer group from the prior year. Subsequently, in May 2024, the HR and Compensation Committee approved one peer addition (IBM Corporation) and two peer removals (VMware, Inc. and Charter Communications, Inc.) for purposes of fiscal 2025 compensation determinations. The new peer group is intended to be more reflective of our market cap and include more relevant industry comparators, and also accounts for acquisitions. \u200b 62 \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 2025 PROXY STATEMENT \u200b Figure 12: Qualcomm\u2019s Relative Rankings Among Peer Companies (1) \u200b \u200b Revenues \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b Company \u200b \u200b $ Millions \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b T-Mobile US \u200b \u200b \u200b $ 79,571 \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b Accenture \u200b \u200b \u200b $ 63,144 \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b Intel \u200b \u200b \u200b $ 63,054 \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b Charter \u200b \u200b \u200b $ 54,022 \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b Cisco \u200b \u200b \u200b $ 53,161 \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b Oracle \u200b \u200b \u200b $ 47,958 \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b Qualcomm \u200b \u200b \u200b $ 42,958 \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b Broadcom \u200b \u200b \u200b $ 34,412 \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b Netflix \u200b \u200b \u200b $ 31,616 \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b salesforce.com \u200b \u200b \u200b $ 31,352 \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b Visa \u200b \u200b \u200b $ 30,187 \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b PayPal \u200b \u200b \u200b $ 27,518 \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b NVIDIA \u200b \u200b \u200b $ 26,974 \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b Appli